# Agent session worktrees. A worktree is a full checkout, so an unignored one is staged by any
# `git add -A` as a single 160000 gitlink pointing at a commit no clone can fetch. Keep these two
# entries narrow -- a blanket `.claude/` would also hide `.claude/skills/repo-profile.md`.
.claude/worktrees/
.worktrees/

